{
  "id": "Convert Sorted Array to Binary Search Tree",
  "title": "Convert Sorted Array To Binary Search Tree",
  "difficulty": "Medium",
  "category": "",
  "tags": [],
  "description": "<p>Given an integer array <code>nums</code> where the elements are sorted in <strong>ascending order</strong>, convert <em>it to a </em><span class=\"cursor-pointer relative text-dark-blue-s text-sm\" data-keyword=\"height-balanced\"><button aria-controls=\"radix-_r_1m_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\" type=\"button\"><strong><em>height-balanced</em></strong></button></span> <em>binary search tree</em>.</p> <p> </p> <p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p> <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/problem_images/a6092bc97d6185b6342644e3b8892d58fc141eadd78230789192eb540c377352.jpg\" style=\"width: 302px; height: 222px;\"/> <pre><strong>Input:</strong> nums = [-10,-3,0,5,9]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [0,-3,9,-10,null,5]\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> [0,-10,5,null,-3,null,9] is also accepted:\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/problem_images/88a0a40add46b22afe025a54bb4a5b46859a5bd91d5e53d5d8aa311a024b7d26.jpg\" style=\"width: 302px; height: 222px;\"/>\n</pre> <p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p> <img alt=\"\" src=\"assets/problem_images/cb3cab769d17acab02cda38950ea9119c7b902123dfa44736dfae345efc98eb7.jpg\" style=\"width: 342px; height: 142px;\"/> <pre><strong>Input:</strong> nums = [1,3]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [3,1]\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> [1,null,3] and [3,1] are both height-balanced BSTs.\n</pre> <p> </p> <p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p> <ul> <li><code>1 &lt;= nums.length &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li> <li><code>-10<sup>4</sup> &lt;= nums[i] &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li> <li><code>nums</code> is sorted in a <strong>strictly increasing</strong> order.</li> </ul>",
  "hints": [],
  "method": {
    "name": "sortedArrayToBST",
    "returnType": "auto",
    "params": [
      {
        "name": "nums",
        "type": "array"
      }
    ]
  },
